{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/o46imvrc2omeu4sd8yiv5oo5x31ubgn.mp3","text":"嗯？不是说过，你敲门之后我要是不答应，你就不准进来吗？你的办公室？值班？那我不也是因为值班才出自己房间的吗？你的办公室是什么意思，册起册起册起，我还在构思哪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/gkbr7ppo8q3nrp1ndhx9vkvglwx7ogc.mp3","text":"嗯？不是说过，你敲门之后我要是不答应，你就不准进来吗？你的办公室？值班？那我不也是因为值班才出自己房间的吗？你的办公室是什么意思，册起册起册起，我还在构思哪。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/7td0msocfmnh3627bb0r3w4e0nrbc3n.mp3","text":"你想看画？可以。如果是你的话，送你张画也可以。但你要是喜欢这画，我就不会送你。你不喜欢？那更不用给你了。我这个人就这样，知足吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/cjjszpf015vb73l2349bosv4p92bwhl.mp3","text":"我被困在这艘船上了。要是有人问起来你就和他们这么说，这屋子也别让他们进来。占用公共空间？拒绝履行干员义务？你好，我是被困在这个房间里的大画家，夕。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/tu0iz2wz950hv0cunfu1wug1qr8m794.mp3","text":"不出去。别喊我出去了，弗想出去。外面的世界，我不在乎了。不喜欢？我当然喜欢。山川风月，花羽林渊，贩夫走卒，老少男女，画不尽，也看不完，越不过，也走不出。我兴致尽了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/pie8518z86hf1ewk4rmiuckoys9uzgt.mp3","text":"你想看画？可以。如果是你的话，送你张画也可以。但你要是喜欢这画，我就不会送你。你不喜欢？那更不用给你了。我这个人就这样，知足吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/99bxo7wc3zywpesakohq9fgotei6pmp.mp3","text":"我被困在这艘船上了。要是有人问起来你就和他们这么说，这屋子也别让他们进来。占用公共空间？拒绝履行干员义务？你好，我是被困在这个房间里的大画家，夕。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/bqzfca4l9rrjh5lmffg7yhjhw65t1ac.mp3","text":"不出去。别喊我出去了，弗想出去。外面的世界，我不在乎了。不喜欢？我当然喜欢。山川风月，花羽林渊，贩夫走卒，老少男女，画不尽，也看不完，越不过，也走不出。我兴致尽了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/sgp8iz96194qoko49tsxp99uc6tdpbu.mp3","text":"我讨厌品味这词。开口就把人堵在门外，谁给他们的自信让他们觉得就自己配得上好物什？那样子是最凹糟的。只要尽兴，就是得意。而想要进取，就不准有门户之见。你见过天上双月自私自利吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/8sztehexwaftkchu7dlix5v9ue2l3l1.mp3","text":"看我认真作画的机会，就算这大地上万中挑一的人，一生也最多一次。“时来天地皆同力”，气、骨、形、色、法，无一不从无一不至，倾泻如浩荡江河，细密如山间竹影，手中这笔，我都停不下它。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/6dglbckryi6amsyvgvsdow1yu7zrjcu.mp3","text":"我讨厌品味这词。开口就把人堵在门外，谁给他们的自信让他们觉得就自己配得上好物什？那样子是最凹糟的。只要尽兴，就是得意。而想要进取，就不准有门户之见。你见过天上双月自私自利吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/hogio6dvwybpt99zqvt1z0020jc40dr.mp3","text":"看我认真作画的机会，就算这大地上万中挑一的人，一生也最多一次。“时来天地皆同力”，气、骨、形、色、法，无一不从无一不至，倾泻如浩荡江河，细密如山间竹影，手中这笔，我都停不下它。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/26zp9u6id8xig2roye9j5wooatr147o.mp3","text":"这段时日我也找了些现在的作品来看。电影还不错，和画很像，好的那些风骨各异，形在，意也不差。好啊，诗和画都算是有传承了。能顺手帮我把年那一屋的垃圾烧了吗？她真的在侮辱电影，拜托。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/i1xcxdyito9tjqk5mkukldy287ymzee.mp3","text":"饭菜到了？喔，谢谢。嗯~是哪一国的酒？不错呀。蛮好，还是缺了些什么的味道才更真切。好奇我平常吃什么？你，来，闭上眼。啊~是不是没感觉？没错，只要你没看过，我画里的饭菜就不存在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/hbnirheld9kghi15dkm3qnqfxuj3elh.mp3","text":"看年那一副满不在乎的样子，其实你也知道吧，她对我们的生死在意的不得了，而我，我虽然跟那个在留白上涂涂写写的家伙合不太来，但我们两个的确不在意。人死了，画还在。我死了，笔意还在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/5iz1vah9kqu2nb04oe5o0ee54sqrg8d.mp3","text":"这段时日我也找了些现在的作品来看。电影还不错，和画很像，好的那些风骨各异，形在，意也不差。好啊，诗和画都算是有传承了。能顺手帮我把年那一屋的垃圾烧了吗？她真的在侮辱电影，拜托。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/lbpzfxazznasq9z5jof5dmqktjlpcrc.mp3","text":"饭菜到了？喔，谢谢。嗯~是哪一国的酒？不错呀。蛮好，还是缺了些什么的味道才更真切。好奇我平常吃什么？你，来，闭上眼。啊~是不是没感觉？没错，只要你没看过，我画里的饭菜就不存在。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/53/2bcjmw8pycm2m39wnr68e0lxvizh9vh.mp3","text":"看年那一副满不在乎的样子，其实你也知道吧，她对我们的生死在意的不得了，而我，我虽然跟那个在留白上涂涂写写的家伙合不太来，但我们两个的确不在意。人死了，画还在。我死了，笔意还在。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/ccw8x7go2c2ppb0pdcovp4ej4d30miq.mp3","text":"梦如人生，梦入长卷。人这一睡，会睡过几个千年呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/hemtzbjf4irskj5iqls6f7gmuua0bhr.mp3","text":"梦如人生，梦入长卷。人这一睡，会睡过几个千年呢？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/lyra0mwo6kp4a9e4swx1qyzk44kjznj.mp3","text":"啊？博士？又是合同？好了好了，签了以后你可别再来烦我。拿去......事先讲好，夕我，从不送画，谁都不送。也不接单！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/cq2a4ywrmwlcmosj75o5h93wxnottb8.mp3","text":"啊？博士？又是合同？好了好了，签了以后你可别再来烦我。拿去......事先讲好，夕我，从不送画，谁都不送。也不接单！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/d0qrb6a8xwzhkyjv1ri0f6by1gzoz8b.mp3","text":"嗯？操戈杀伐，血流成河，难道说......你想让我画这些？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/3ne1yhrs7y2t4jtck9tlwk8i690wjh1.mp3","text":"嗯？操戈杀伐，血流成河，难道说......你想让我画这些？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/ezjssvd3aahfmsxmmpz0q9rr9q2y3ai.mp3","text":"我为什么用剑？那可有讲究，“以砚为鞘，可以研春秋；以笔为剑，可以涂鬼神”。真的假的？自然是我随便说的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/9t63plfdqnni38nvyaxi3xi1ztm0bhl.mp3","text":"我为什么用剑？那可有讲究，“以砚为鞘，可以研春秋；以笔为剑，可以涂鬼神”。真的假的？自然是我随便说的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/1oztgnlgtrn9uq68lw6giz8pl8x6zo0.mp3","text":"嚯，能跟我走到这步......我就给你画一幅吧。当心！可别陷进去，另片天地可比这里迷人太多了。从古至今看得破、离得开、忘得掉的，又有几人呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/04/n2n273hfc8221r56rj76cxbf5otehaq.mp3","text":"嚯，能跟我走到这步......我就给你画一幅吧。当心！可别陷进去，另片天地可比这里迷人太多了。从古至今看得破、离得开、忘得掉的，又有几人呢？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/gbizcdd8tjpueyb4tnuow2kibbws03t.mp3","text":"可别耽误我太长时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/98/9oqdda48x12s069g2s66ojwc06t76i5.mp3","text":"可别耽误我太长时间。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/37t4fwh2ms3oxjxsnkgmh95xla8hgrb.mp3","text":"队长？那是干什么的？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/qqy9v8073kbe8od2po7m9khy6kb2kow.mp3","text":"队长？那是干什么的？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/oe7cq27u0x00h76so7c3dmobveog8pz.mp3","text":"那就赶紧了结了吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/71fqmhzskq6cdoabj1t6secgj17y4og.mp3","text":"那就赶紧了结了吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/qn61jznl80wrj31713dwjrrxt05mdrs.mp3","text":"今天我心情不错，就送你们一幅《沙场白骨图》吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/2ta1qialrlf32ym2v0fj44mdlc9bpbm.mp3","text":"今天我心情不错，就送你们一幅《沙场白骨图》吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/jypzoxawwad6iyj73ccagn142zujizm.mp3","text":"可别太过分。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/p3e4kz0r35lm5wfwqynvf5bxzau2j3m.mp3","text":"细笔还是留在家里画吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/8jd545xu84bgs17wj5rtd0iipt9sxf9.mp3","text":"可别太过分。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/pbcphk5modioi2g33r6uc6rjuts9ouf.mp3","text":"细笔还是留在家里画吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/0y1re6l3ymwzyckodoafzeor088kzev.mp3","text":"你们有人想做我的颜料吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/pfzp2nl2jlmpnz2vvc43642qeoxoonv.mp3","text":"这片战场，适合泼墨法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/7cfg6w2hwzw3fm84uehwrtb0sw4r20l.mp3","text":"你们有人想做我的颜料吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/nuvxibzcowsfpo6wevk6njg0reuzelz.mp3","text":"这片战场，适合泼墨法。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/mq21kyk1wu5j80pnq1ch6dxquo7hvf0.mp3","text":"讲话太难懂了，我画出来给你看看。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/qyv737e1i9esa997qqys34g5tlu8kgh.mp3","text":"落锋长日坠，起笔叠嶂起！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/n2qdt7kpfchwpafbzb4mqktk4o37xju.mp3","text":"以有形摹无垠，以无形应天下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/m79pbrvtb6s2bpdlx7943yn92yjpnr1.mp3","text":"我对你们还算是有感情的。大多数时候。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/c29i4oocrfs7vpc1ai4gmam4s9i47cf.mp3","text":"讲话太难懂了，我画出来给你看看。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/dumzznr4ezuucvwljq9l1gkv1w6cfj1.mp3","text":"落锋长日坠，起笔叠嶂起！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/4qcta55cvricedbg2zfvvyubmmcwkni.mp3","text":"以有形摹无垠，以无形应天下！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/oik4jf4r04q9yziscg0kem7f5nddnua.mp3","text":"我对你们还算是有感情的。大多数时候。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/9mzc7m0bfp4kgupi0midzbjf0udjlq6.mp3","text":"丹青与干戈，本来是离得很远的。但劲力到了，战争也是艺术。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/qh05ozaw4e98so8k7tku3a0ldre0sv9.mp3","text":"丹青与干戈，本来是离得很远的。但劲力到了，战争也是艺术。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/mf3288127bkknygrvuylw2lnancw7zl.mp3","text":"还不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/26ijp0stsnjbcpsv2hg1dzyzn9wtgwa.mp3","text":"还不错。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/9kuacsf17orwj0ox3gwkrnlhv68il0l.mp3","text":"嗯......没画好的画就该撕掉。会让自己丢脸的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/mb5z0wszetbcrlqmsjcgga74yc2h1m1.mp3","text":"嗯......没画好的画就该撕掉。会让自己丢脸的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/ne9ki233k45in38t8tiayfcn7ujfxe9.mp3","text":"笔锋散了吧？重画吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/03gsstyqet59cxdq7pndbn93lrft0ne.mp3","text":"笔锋散了吧？重画吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/drhg6zkwwgutso163nrk9fcqsv3lgcn.mp3","text":"房间装修就不用帮我准备了。我会自己准备的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/4qncl1mcmgprz7dohwm7xbcnrrdmlf5.mp3","text":"房间装修就不用帮我准备了。我会自己准备的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/gwok3769uqo604ejn5h0u9fui5psk6c.mp3","text":"墨汁要洒了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/mxscvz5eqa91p4mie2j3za24z1twtel.mp3","text":"墨汁要洒了！","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/crciyj4s8ljyujuqwz166ubcjoi87ry.mp3","text":"喂，可别沾得一身都是颜料。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/6aopjexp10vy8el7ro311gn3dehx5a5.mp3","text":"喂，可别沾得一身都是颜料。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/akd39ay2r12wpccxag4rqutz53y4o05.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/77/tr6lt6hz6vms4l0irlx0cmfpsdwh2pl.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/k1x2pxm1jl8psl7hzefo12rqhn9wgzb.mp3","text":"新年？人这一生已经够短暂了，就好像对着方寸画卷还要仔细分割，想着这一块画什么、那一块画什么，周而复始，生死疲劳。不过也罢，一时欢笑筵宴，也算是一道风景。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/dxjxrns7pnctssdq7nxx6md44wx8ayi.mp3","text":"新年？人这一生已经够短暂了，就好像对着方寸画卷还要仔细分割，想着这一块画什么、那一块画什么，周而复始，生死疲劳。不过也罢，一时欢笑筵宴，也算是一道风景。","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/sl07tzk51ap9jvmtdv5crm2ri2uxef5.mp3","text":"你的名字是啥来着，哦，博士？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2015_dusk/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/636m5hw41g29zoavyh9jkiavpptbhy1.mp3","text":"你的名字是啥来着，哦，博士？","alt":"voice_custom/char_2015_dusk_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/ry7vgqm7tiopj1en6nturzzj7gyd1ml.mp3","text":"嗯？不是说过，你敲门之后我要是不答应，你就不准进来吗？你的办公室？值班？那我不也是因为值班才出自己房间的吗？你的办公室是什么意思，册起册起册起，我还在构思哪。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/lv2lrt0johca89fka48grcjmfktw46d.mp3","text":"你想看画？可以。如果是你的话，送你张画也可以。但你要是喜欢这画，我就不会送你。你不喜欢？那更不用给你了。我这个人就这样，知足吧。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/3lj2e3byz6vch7z44uev4pu00wo3kvp.mp3","text":"我被困在这艘船上了。要是有人问起来你就和他们这么说，这屋子也别让他们进来。占用公共空间？拒绝履行干员义务？你好，我是被困在这个房间里的大画家，夕。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/gkqnrij5imzcdhg2b3i49b7acymusg7.mp3","text":"不出去。别喊我出去了，弗想出去。外面的世界，我不在乎了。不喜欢？我当然喜欢。山川风月，花羽林渊，贩夫走卒，老少男女，画不尽，也看不完，越不过，也走不出。我兴致尽了。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/qjk241wtd5twtj7imq2lqy5gaz13dio.mp3","text":"我讨厌品味这词。开口就把人堵在门外，谁给他们的自信让他们觉得就自己配得上好物什？那样子是最凹糟的。只要尽兴，就是得意。而想要进取，就不准有门户之见。你见过天上双月自私自利吗？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/8xfni51u9fqhtdjgouwg7ejtefls9b5.mp3","text":"看我认真作画的机会，就算这大地上万中挑一的人，一生也最多一次。“时来天地皆同力”，气、骨、形、色、法，无一不从无一不至，倾泻如浩荡江河，细密如山间竹影，手中这笔，我都停不下它。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/e748hkvi3flvoh9t08cisj3v6mthk7z.mp3","text":"这段时日我也找了些现在的作品来看。电影还不错，和画很像，好的那些风骨各异，形在，意也不差。好啊，诗和画都算是有传承了。能顺手帮我把年那一屋的垃圾烧了吗？她真的在侮辱电影，拜托。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/19yjeos84r0q8yrww3ar9uw6d1u3q2x.mp3","text":"饭菜到了？喔，谢谢。嗯~是哪一国的酒？不错呀。蛮好，还是缺了些什么的味道才更真切。好奇我平常吃什么？你，来，闭上眼。啊~是不是没感觉？没错，只要你没看过，我画里的饭菜就不存在。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/pvf7e7vypjkcgc07td8c33r6ndph42n.mp3","text":"看年那一副满不在乎的样子，其实你也知道吧，她对我们的生死在意的不得了，而我，我虽然跟那个在留白上涂涂写写的家伙合不太来，但我们两个的确不在意。人死了，画还在。我死了，笔意还在。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/rdk7n7e7m2vdj63p5ultguaj9catude.mp3","text":"梦如人生，梦入长卷。人这一睡，会睡过几个千年呢？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/pveklqchz13gnxzw2uudy6kkp07bkto.mp3","text":"啊？博士？又是合同？好了好了，签了以后你可别再来烦我。拿去......事先讲好，夕我，从不送画，谁都不送。也不接单！","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/c94ex4p9yuwuyrpr25pxr683a3lsxsz.mp3","text":"嗯？操戈杀伐，血流成河，难道说......你想让我画这些？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/50or7mjf6vsc9lbrtnptbjo6vtrbqyh.mp3","text":"我为什么用剑？那可有讲究，“以砚为鞘，可以研春秋；以笔为剑，可以涂鬼神”。真的假的？自然是我随便说的。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/ncrq99vn6zb1xkdd4dwfjno4rj9l7az.mp3","text":"嚯，能跟我走到这步......我就给你画一幅吧。当心！可别陷进去，另片天地可比这里迷人太多了。从古至今看得破、离得开、忘得掉的，又有几人呢？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/ojrvbkc4pbdv6ef8z0balezdkarking.mp3","text":"可别耽误我太长时间。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/jpah6rfguodizb7hcmvhimcsmw3ux7b.mp3","text":"队长？那是干什么的？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/7dhnfu99up2zekzpbfi2qrtcgl1rcr0.mp3","text":"那就赶紧了结了吧。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/3s9773ytq4zsp6xaxyt367lwzmyo3pa.mp3","text":"今天我心情不错，就送你们一幅《沙场白骨图》吧。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/2gfqlhjgf81te3xckc1c4x034w8tn4h.mp3","text":"可别太过分。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/d264j21ogj9j4zx954y25x2cw2e1tpb.mp3","text":"细笔还是留在家里画吧。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/m8c976wbn358e89vp1qvfazqaf13xiv.mp3","text":"你们有人想做我的颜料吗？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/0i43tw0d120759iyizpzeu58tqfzbc9.mp3","text":"这片战场，适合泼墨法。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/dbfmur2u2sqsgy517740jk4xfe1ykx0.mp3","text":"讲话太难懂了，我画出来给你看看。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/k3gv9vs0uk2pqj9a64n6dhhbmfr9x8l.mp3","text":"落锋长日坠，起笔叠嶂起！","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/psdrtrxd9og1rd561kphlexq3ay9jgn.mp3","text":"以有形摹无垠，以无形应天下！","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/knctmbd5q5kjfrkjv2j3291q9atkdmg.mp3","text":"我对你们还算是有感情的。大多数时候。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/mzg15jtwhfxtdmr30k5knpz2bc1wtby.mp3","text":"丹青与干戈，本来是离得很远的。但劲力到了，战争也是艺术。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/cjas1cgw5ex1906ytq6to6i7lzer1mj.mp3","text":"还不错。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/e4dg1bl09anxb7f7q1nr7qiajins98f.mp3","text":"嗯......没画好的画就该撕掉。会让自己丢脸的。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/84g23e1wg0qkgnm0slop5pv7b6osfyx.mp3","text":"笔锋散了吧？重画吧。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/f83wh0gs6q6nb8krgk9psqqlkjk26w5.mp3","text":"房间装修就不用帮我准备了。我会自己准备的。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/n29o961wh9fkn98iwg9w82vtvp567bp.mp3","text":"墨汁要洒了！","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/bjhg33fzbj87l7jlibg86sgpakov7vi.mp3","text":"喂，可别沾得一身都是颜料。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/gn2gjbh2suw392g5rin3e92fef0qbma.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/4gjeap80bxlfhah8myk73sog1el2lbw.mp3","text":"新年？人这一生已经够短暂了，就好像对着方寸画卷还要仔细分割，想着这一块画什么、那一块画什么，周而复始，生死疲劳。不过也罢，一时欢笑筵宴，也算是一道风景。","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/rqf9f2er85k5uqdxueb2l12j2m0n8ev.mp3","text":"你的名字是啥来着，哦，博士？","alt":"voice/char_2015_dusk/cn_042.mp3"}]}}